  unitName: "Chloe (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 850507
  unitNumber: 8368
  description: Chloe is the Commander of the Scarlet Flame Imperial Guard of Envylia.
    She slashes down her enemies with a blade as big as herself. Due to her over-serious
    personality, she doesn't allow herself to be lazy, and she's quite strict to
    the people around her as well. It is said however, that she actually has a more
    innocent side to her, such as when she makes conversation with her stuffed toys
    before sleeping.
  summonDesc: Wh-What did you call me? Pl-Please. I still haven't fully earned the
    title of Captain.
  fusionDesc: I still lack in strength. I know that. I need to train more and become
    stronger!
